cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this standard, please cite the paper that describes it,
  listed under preferred-citation.
title: bh-audit-schema
abstract: >-
  An open, versioned JSON Schema standard for behavioral health audit
  events, with a FHIR R5 AuditEvent profile and reference translator.
  PHI-minimizing by construction and mapped to HIPAA Security Rule,
  42 CFR Part 2, and SOC 2 control objectives. Version 2.0 adds a
  three-role attribution model (authenticating, acting, authorizing)
  that makes AI agent-mediated access to patient records attributable,
  with validation that rejects an unattributed agent action.
